[[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025534\">5530B10</a></p><p>1. Open retaining collars (1a) and remove sleeve (1b) from air cleaner\nto flow meter.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002292.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the connection sleeve between air cleaner\nand flow meter.</p><p>Do up the collars securing the pipe to\nthe flow meter and the rigid air intake pipe to the turbo.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025534\">5530B10</a></p>"]]